  "body": "## Release Notes\n\n### Other\n\n- *(deps)* bump regex from 1.13.1 to 1.13.2\n- *(deps)* bump clap from 4.6.8 to 4.6.9\n- *(deps)* bump aws-sdk-mwaa from 1.131.0 to 1.132.0\n\n## Install flowrs-tui 0.16.7\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via shell script\n\n```sh\ncurl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/releases/download/flowrs-tui-v0.16.7/flowrs-tui-installer.sh | sh\n```\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via Homebrew\n\n```sh\nbrew install jvanbuel/flowrs/flowrs\n```\n\n## Download flowrs-tui 0.16.7\n\n|  File  | Platform | Checksum |\n|--------|----------|----------|\n| [flowrs-tui-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/releases/download/flowrs-tui-v0.16.7/flowrs-tui-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Apple Silicon macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/releases/download/flowrs-tui-v0.16.7/flowrs-tui-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [flowrs-tui-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/releases/download/flowrs-tui-v0.16.7/flowrs-tui-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Intel macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/releases/download/flowrs-tui-v0.16.7/flowrs-tui-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [flowrs-tui-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/releases/download/flowrs-tui-v0.16.7/flowrs-tui-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | x64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/releases/download/flowrs-tui-v0.16.7/flowrs-tui-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n\n\n"
